{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Robots used to be our loyal everyday companions. They made coffee, mowed lawns, and reminded you to water that dying plant. Life was easy\u2026 until everything went haywire.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One massive system failure later, our trusty walking toasters suddenly started attacking anything without a USB port. Ever since then, it's been chaos on every floor. And nobody to unload the dishwasher\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Your mission: <strong>save the city</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unapologetically feminine <strong>FPS</strong>, take on rogue robots with grace and glamour. Why choose between <strong>cute</strong> and <strong>badass</strong> when you can be both? Whether you\u2019re a <strong>seasoned fighter </strong>or a <strong>curious newcomer</strong> to the FPS genre, you\u2019ll find missions for <strong>every skill level</strong>. Progress at your own pace and become an unstoppable love machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip an arsenal full of charm and chaos. Toss a <strong>glitter bomb</strong> for a flashy entrance, fire <strong>laser hearts</strong>, unleash <strong>bubble cannons</strong>, or slice gracefully through enemies with the elegance of your <strong>cherry blossom-pink katana</strong>. Or get weird<strong>, launch a cat</strong> straight into a robot\u2019s face.\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2432230?t=1769962403","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769962403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432230/cbc5825e2da99891f6790f774c60b4e0b270d3c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769962403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432230/cbc5825e2da99891f6790f774c60b4e0b270d3c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769962403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Robots used to be our loyal everyday companions. They made coffee, mowed lawns, and reminded you to water that dying plant. Life was easy\u2026 until everything went haywire.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One massive system failure later, our trusty walking toasters suddenly started attacking anything without a USB port. Ever since then, it's been chaos on every floor. And nobody to unload the dishwasher\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> Your mission: <strong>save the city</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unapologetically feminine <strong>FPS</strong>, take on rogue robots with grace and glamour. Why choose between <strong>cute</strong> and <strong>badass</strong> when you can be both? Whether you\u2019re a <strong>seasoned fighter </strong>or a <strong>curious newcomer</strong> to the FPS genre, you\u2019ll find missions for <strong>every skill level</strong>. Progress at your own pace and become an unstoppable love machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip an arsenal full of charm and chaos. Toss a <strong>glitter bomb</strong> for a flashy entrance, fire <strong>laser hearts</strong>, unleash <strong>bubble cannons</strong>, or slice gracefully through enemies with the elegance of your <strong>cherry blossom-pink katana</strong>. Or get weird<strong>, launch a cat</strong> straight into a robot\u2019s face.\u00a0</p>","developers":["Glitter Games","Zeldars Zone"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2432230/header.jpg?t=1769962403","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2432230/789350/1b96